{"abstract":"We present the most recent results from the FASTSUM collaboration for hadron properties at high temperature. This includes the temperature dependence of the light and charmed meson and baryon spectrum, as well as properties of heavy quarkonia. The results are obtained using anisotropic lattices with a fixed scale approach. We also present the status of our next generation gauge ensembles.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Skullerud, Jon-Ivar","Aarts, Gert","Allton, Chris","Anwar, M. Naeem","Bignell, Ryan","Burns, Tim","Chaves García-Mascaraque, Sergio","Hands, Simon","Horohan D’Arcy, Rachel","Jäger, Benjamin","Kim, Seyong","Lombardo, Maria Paola","Murphy, Eoghan","Offler, Sam","Page, Ben","Ryan, Sinéad M.","Spriggs, Thomas","Stasiak, Dawid","Ziegler, Felix P.G."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-593578"],"event":{"end":"2022-08-06","place":"Stavanger, no","start":"2022-08-01","title":"XVth Quark Confinement and the Hadron Spectrum Conference","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Skullerud, Jon-Ivar"],"country":["Ireland","Italy","South Korea","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","INFN Sezione di Firenze","Maynooth University","Sejong University","Swansea University","The University of Edinburgh","Trinity College Dublin","University of Liverpool"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hadrons at high temperature an update from the fastsum collaboration","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1051/epjconf/202227405011","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-593578","identifier":[{"