{"author_count":7,"contributors":["Murphy, Ronan A.","Christiansen, Stig Hill","Sabnis, A","Schelenz, S","Vorup-Jensen, Thomas","Davies, Jane C.","Edwards, A"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-272087"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Imperial College London","Royal Brompton and Harefield NHS Foundation Trust"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"glatiramer acetate is an antibiotic resistance breaker against cystic fibrosis strains of pseudomonas aeruginosa via disruption of the bacterial outer membrane","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ppul.22495","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-272087","identifier":[{"id":"000484544000003","type":"wos"},{"id":"31487429","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85071740879","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-fa422143-0dc6-4310-8a3e-51ed5e2c76f3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F086C42B8706C59F6CCF3E7EBCDB0FEF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ppul.22495","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"imperial college london","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Imperial College London","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Biomedicine, Department of Biomedicine - Forskning og uddannelse, Skou-bygningen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"royal brompton and harefield nhs foundation trust","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Royal Brompton and Harefield NHS Foundation Trust","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ronan A.","key":"murphypau","last":"Murphy","name":"Murphy, Ronan A.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Stig","key":"hillchristiansenpau","last":"Hill Christiansen","locid":"160328a2-5d38-4540-a7fa-d5c3e6fb6c35","name":"Christiansen, Stig Hill","name_org":"Hill Christiansen, Stig","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"A","key":"sabnispau","last":"Sabnis","name":"Sabnis, A","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"S","key":"schelenzpau","last":"Schelenz","name":"Schelenz, S","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"vorupjensenpau","last":"Vorup-Jensen","locid":"77b03498-95a4-453b-81a8-e2c05fa0ca0c","name":"Vorup-Jensen, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-4140-6563","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jane C.","key":"daviespau","last":"Davies","name":"Davies, Jane C.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"A","key":"edwardspau","last":"Edwards","name":"Edwards, A","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31487429"],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-fa422143-0dc6-4310-8a3e-51ed5e2c76f3"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"GLATIRAMER ACETATE IS AN ANTIBIOTIC RESISTANCE BREAKER AGAINST CYSTIC FIBROSIS STRAINS OF PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA VIA DISRUPTION OF THE BACTERIAL OUTER MEMBRANE","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-272087","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"This paper represents an expert view from Europe of future emerging technologies within the wind energy sector considering their potential, challenges, applications and technology readiness and how they might evolve in the coming years. These technologies were identified as originating primarily from the academic sector, some start-up companies and a few larger industrial entities. The following areas were considered: airborne wind energy, offshore floating concepts, smart rotors, wind-induced energy harvesting devices, blade tip-mounted rotors, unconventional power transmission systems, multi-rotor turbines, alternative support structures, modular high voltage direct current generators, innovative blade manufacturing techniques, diffuser-augmented turbines and small turbine technologies. The future role of advanced multiscale modelling and data availability is also considered. This expert review has highlighted that more research will be required to realise many of these emerging technologies. However, there is a need to identify synergies between fundamental and industrial research by correctly targeting public and private funding in these emerging technology areas as industrial development may outpace more fundamental research faster than anticipated.","author_count":32,"contributors":["Watson, Simon","Moro, Alberto","Reis, Vera","Baniotopoulos, Charalampos","Barth, Stephan","Bartoli, Gianni","Bauer, Florian","Boelman, Elisa","Bosse, Dennis","Cherubini, Antonello","Croce, Alessandro","Fagiano, Lorenzo","Fontana, Marco","Gambier, Adrian","Gkoumas, Konstantinos","Golightly, Christopher","Latour, Mikel Iribas","Jamieson, Peter","Kaldellis, John","Macdonald, Andrew","Murphy, Jimmy","Muskulus, Michael","Petrini, Francesco","Pigolotti, Luca","Rasmussen, Flemming","Schild, Philippe","Schmehl, Roland","Stavridou, Nafsika","Tande, John","Taylor, Nigel","Telsnig, Thomas","Wiser, Ryan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-331962"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Watson, Simon"],"country":["Belgium","Germany","Greece","Ireland","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Spain","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Delft University of Technology","European Commission","ForWind","Fraunhofer Institute for Wind Energy and Energy System Technology","National Renewable Energy Center","Norwegian University of Science and Technology","Offshore Renewable Energy Catapult","Politecnico di Milano","RWTH Aachen University","SINTEF","Technical University of Munich","University College Cork","University of Birmingham","University of Florence","University of Pisa","University of Rome La Sapienza","University of Strathclyde","University of West Attica","Università di Trento"],"keyword":["Emerging technology","Renewable energy","Technology readiness level","Wind energy","Wind power"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"future emerging technologies in the wind power sector a european perspective","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/190548942/1_s2.0_S1364032119304782_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-331962","identifier":[{"id":"85069687781","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-5c17e320-b495-424a-93c0-59aeab306e65"],"keyword":["Emerging technology","Renewable energy","Technology readiness level","Wind energy","Wind power"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EB865E946E9F18839AC2C7740CBB2B9E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/190548942/1_s2.0_S1