{"abstract":"Research funders are increasingly concerned with measurable socio-economic impact of investment in research, and on increasingly shorter timescales. Innovation, and “open innovation” are the policy priorities of the moment and optimising the flow of ideas along the lab-2-market spectrum is essential for re-use of results, fuelling open innovation, and boosting socio-economic impact or public funded research.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Grigorov, Ivo","Bayliss-Brown, Georgia","Murphy, David","Thøgersen, Thomas Talund","Mariani, Patrizio"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-320319"],"event":{"end":"2017-04-28","place":"Vienna, at","start":"2017-04-23","title":"European Geosciences Union General Assembly 2017","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Ireland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","AquaTT"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"passive vs active knowledge transfer boosting grant proposal impact","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/142180675/EGU2017_18355_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-320319","ids":["dtu-34e7c72e-348b-4171-b311-d815ee51af77"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-04E8BE373DE75CAD639610A127CC1318"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/142180675/EGU2017_18355_2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":[