":239,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"T.","key":"yodatpau","last":"Yoda","name":"Yoda, T.","rank":240,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"D.","key":"yvondpau","last":"Yvon","name":"Yvon, D.","rank":241,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"zaccheiapau","last":"Zacchei","name":"Zacchei, A.","rank":242,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"A.","key":"zoncaapau","last":"Zonca","name":"Zonca, A.","rank":243,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1051/0004-6361/201321553","issn":["00046361","14320746"],"issn_org":["00046361"],"journal":"Astronomy & Astrophysics","paperid":"A13","publisher":"EDP Sciences","status":"p","title":"Astronomy & Astrophysics","title_org":"Astronomy and Astrophysics","volume":"571"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84908653939"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-c2df359f-bda8-4cc8-a22f-dfab316060a8","ku-d3b84a32-917d-4d38-b74c-0b8cb2b417fe"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Planck 2013 results. XIII. Galactic CO emission","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-083.81-037008","year":"2014","yearsub":2015}
{"abstract":"The genetic contribution to the variation in human lifespan is ∼ 25%. Despite the large number of identified disease-susceptibility loci, it is not known which loci influence population mortality. We performed a genome-wide association meta-analysis of 7729 long-lived individuals of European descent (≥ 85 years) and 16 121 younger controls (<65 years) followed by replication in an additional set of 13 060 long-lived individuals and 61 156 controls. In addition, we performed a subset analysis in cases aged ≥ 90 years. We observed genome-wide significant association with longevity, as reflected by survival to ages beyond 90 years, at a novel locus, rs2149954, on chromosome 5q33.3 (OR = 1.10, P = 1.74 × 10(-8)). We also confirmed association of rs4420638 on chromosome 19q13.32 (OR = 0.72, P = 3.40 × 10(-36)), representing the TOMM40/APOE/APOC1 locus. In a prospective meta-analysis (n = 34 103), the minor allele of rs2149954 (T) on chromosome 5q33.3 associates with increased survival (HR = 0.95, P = 0.003). This allele has previously been reported to associate with low blood pressure in middle age. Interestingly, the minor allele (T) associates with decreased cardiovascular mortality risk, independent of blood pressure. We report on the first GWAS-identified longevity locus on chromosome 5q33.3 influencing survival in the general European population. The minor allele of this locus associates with low blood pressure in middle age, although the contribution of this allele to survival may be less dependent on blood pressure. Hence, the pleiotropic mechanisms by which this intragenic variation contributes to lifespan regulation have to be elucidated.","author_count":87,"contributors":["Deelen, Joris","Beekman, Marian","Uh, Hae-Won","Broer, Linda","Ayers, Kristin L","Tan, Qihua","Kamatani, Yoichiro","Bennet, Anna M","Tamm, Riin","Trompet, Stella","Guðbjartsson, Daníel F","Flachsbart, Friederike","Rose, Giuseppina","Viktorin, Alexander","Fischer, Krista","Nygaard, Marianne","Cordell, Heather J","Crocco, Paolina","van den Akker, Erik B","Böhringer, Stefan","Helmer, Quinta","Nelson, Christopher P","Saunders, Gary I","Alver, Maris","Andersen-Ranberg, Karen","Breen, Marie E","van der Breggen, Ruud","Caliebe, Amke","Capri, Miriam","Cevenini, Elisa","Collerton, Joanna C","Dato, Serena","Davies, Karen","Ford, Ian","Gampe, Jutta","Garagnani, Paolo","de Geus, Eco J C","Harrow, Jennifer","van Heemst, Diana","Heijmans, Bastiaan T","Heinsen, Femke-Anouska","Hottenga, Jouke-Jan","Hofman, Albert","Jeune, Bernard","Jonsson, Palmi V","Lathrop, Mark","Lechner, Doris","Martin-Ruiz, Carmen","Mcnerlan, Susan E","Mihailov, Evelin","Montesanto, Alberto","Mooijaart, Simon P","Murphy, Anne","Nohr, Ellen A","Paternoster, Lavinia","Postmus, Iris","Rivadeneira, Fernando","Ross, Owen A","Salvioli, Stefano","Sattar, Naveed","Schreiber, Stefan","Stefánsson, Hreinn","Stott, David J","Tiemeier, Henning","Uitterlinden, André G","Westendorp, Rudi G J","Willemsen, Gonneke","Samani, Nilesh J","Galan, Pilar","Sørensen, Thorkild I A","Boomsma, Dorret I","Jukema, J Wouter","Rea, Irene Maeve","Passarino, Giuseppe","de Craen, Anton J M","Christensen, Kaare","Nebel, Almut","Stefánsson, Kári","Metspalu, Andres","Magnusson, Patrik","Blanché, Hélène","Christiansen, Lene","Kirkwood, Thomas B L","van Duijn, Cornelia M","Franceschi, Claudio","Houwing-Duistermaat, Jeanine J","Slagboom, P Eline"],"cuid":["S02-099.84-044127"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Leiden University"],"keyword":["Age Factors","Aged","Aged 80 and over","Cardiovascular Diseases genetics","Chromosome Mapping","Chromosomes Human Pair 19","Chromosomes Human Pair 5","European Continental Ancestry Group","Female","Genome Wide Association Study","Humans","Hypertension genetics","Longevity genetics","Male","Phenotype","Prospective Studies"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genome wide association meta analysis of human longevity identifies a novel locus conferring survival beyond 000000000090 years of age","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/hmg/ddu139","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-099.84-044127","identifier":[{"id":"84904741764","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24688116","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC4103672","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-87b6edf9-8fb2-46e9-9d0c-698ffc09e2a4","sdu-a95bcb8f-a9ed-452f-a17d-14822d34aecf"],"keyword":["Age Factors","Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Cardiovascular Diseases/genetics","Chromosome Mapping","Chromosomes, Human, Pair 19","Chromosomes, Human, Pair 5","European Continental Ancestry Group","Female","Genetic Loci/physiology","Genome-Wide Association Study","Humans","Hypertension/genetics","Longevity/genetics","Male","Phenotype","Prospective Studies"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-6C300B6EBA838FE4DB49745162A5D2C3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/hmg/ddu139","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"nl","key":"leiden university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Leiden University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences,